    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11586" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπασκᾰρίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					839
				</span></i>
			:—<i>struggle, be convulsed,</i>
			like a dying fish, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὡσπερεὶ πέρκην χαμαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					495
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπασκαριῶ γέλωτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπησκάρισεν</span>
			<i>gave up the ghost,</i> prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεσκ-,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.114
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Nicarch.
			</span></i>).</div>
